NPC dialogue oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-16. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Routes the CheckFact calls of TacticalAI/NPC.cc through OracleTracedCheckFact and traces the dialogue events ConverseFull
and the trigger functions queue (TalkingMenuDialogue, NPCDoAction, NPCGotoGridNo, NPCClosePanel, TalkingMenuGiveItem,
NPCTriggerNPC, TacticalCharacterDialogue) through OracleDialogueTrace, both defined in Oracle.cc and inactive unless a
probe sets a trace. Appends wrappers around the static NPCConsiderTalking, CalcThreateningEffectiveness and
NPCConsiderQuote and accessors for the record arrays. No behaviour change. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0011.

